{
 "about": "Round 69, review of authz-agent PR #147: ${resourceType} in the four filter dialects when the request's resource type differs from the set target in letter case, or carries spaces at its ends. Does the target match, and is the substituted text the request's spelling, the target's, or a normalized one? Controls first and last answer true.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R69_RTSUB_",
 "standVersion": true,
